c_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> for $1,250. It is part of the random rotation in the store.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Moai but with a classic texture.</li>\n<li>It has a small depression at the bottom.</li>\n<li>The description appears to be a reference to the song <i><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hooked_on_a_Feeling\">Hooked On a Feeling</a>.</i></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163118\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 57/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019444/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.771      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   51.771      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2933-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163118 and revision id 17001. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Moai"],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true}],"images":["Classic_Moai.png"]}
